Modifications in this fork (summary):
- Removed the connection, DNS and console log storage and their viewers.
- Removed the firewall bubble, alerts screen, WireGuard network-stats screen,
  per-app domain/IP rule sheets, DNS favicon fetching and the IP-info lookup on
  socket close.
- Replaced data-usage accounting with in-memory counters.
- Replaced the built-in DoH/DoT presets and changed encrypted-DNS failure
  handling so that it does not fall back to system DNS.
- Removed the packet-capture and Go log-level settings.
- Removed the bug-report collector (logcat and app-exit dumps), the Go log and
  crash file readers, the memory profiler, and the events screen.
- Replaced the launcher and adaptive icons. The earlier artwork included the
  Android robot, which is a Google work (CC BY 3.0); the new icon is original.
  Removed an unused Android-robot vector drawable.

